+ \frac{dr^2}{1 - \frac{b(r)}{r}}
+ r^2 d\Omega^2.
\]

The throat condition is
\[
b(r_0) = r_0,
\]
and the traversability probability encoded by the engine is
\[
P_{\text{trav}} = 0.987.
\]

A synthetic curvature classifier used by the simulation engine is defined as
\[
